{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_017_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:862ddc9a512fdd2e0c8d52261d5de82db4276bff692d595f1806f8fd8e784203",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c6d5ac00295ffb1c05d227003ace188dcd7d55b551843d17fdb7edc94d5364c",
      "text": "萌发于桐生心中之物",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dae15f504824e8ac1835557c2a758acba0de0130a6023704dfcb839d2e4cb215",
      "text": "桐生收到了全天跟拍采访的邀请。由于还要前往他所借住的猫柳亭金槌邸进行拍摄，制作人为了取得许可前去造访。然而桐生本人却不知为何静不下心来，表现得反常起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c6d5ac00295ffb1c05d227003ace188dcd7d55b551843d17fdb7edc94d5364c",
      "text": "萌发于桐生心中之物",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a06f62050ce43c86bba87c40d915cdbebd8f6dae36349b9c09756c699368f58c",
      "text": "喵呵呵呵～♪\n吾辈回～来啦喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c057ac8f4ad10729667bea029b0cfbb286c7bf1da5297d7e3283ae4a90bf626",
      "text": "桐生先生！你回来的时机\n刚刚好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c32dfdc1bdc677c92e7d00372b33a94287e2dc8092fae33267a09359df2ed2ec",
      "text": "唔唔，怎么了喵，\n●●●●プロデューサー君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77819c3483cd34269e7042b5976c805911a02563b8abf807f8008b8c2e612048",
      "text": "莫非，是有新工作了喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52d3f8e18663c10e0edea05b17bf96eb820864d7073b4ed98875b38f3b269e7b",
      "text": "是的。有人发来了想对桐生先生进行“全天跟拍采访”的邀请。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a757b59c0d97bb8769cfd918e406d6666c862114232f5715bb5e85185f54b4a",
      "text": "喵喵，听起来很有意思喵～！\n那么，被跟拍的吾辈，该做些什么喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16e6850441a93e96898c544999cf2e409af4a091d931494f2c6437360f3b27d5",
      "text": "“天才落语家兼偶像！想要拍摄不可思议系角色\n猫柳桐生先生在自家的日常生活！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32c3229397b5df09626d5834d1a7b21352e26b258c777e6076ce6bc3f5deef1a",
      "text": "文件上是这么写的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08fe60b4ce8c1f25e708f566cdfea4b6d49fa3b67eba4b41ec9073ef06489413",
      "text": "原来如喵。是想看看神秘的吾辈，\n私底下的模样喵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e9c76c531f4cd2c4ace267e55c101fd4c8be707fc28bb72525579b4f2ee7cf1",
      "text": "桐生先生的家，其实是你的落语师父\n猫柳亭金槌先生的宅邸对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e38e4a56ab56135fdfa8192f719c8e5ba407bc1ab8d58ab82b257cdf7280d57c",
      "text": "然也。自打十二岁拜师以来，就一直\n承蒙横滨的师父关照了喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
